sequenceDiagram
    title 模拟支付：截止前成功路径
    participant user
    participant webApp
    participant paymentService
    participant mysql
    user->>webApp: 确认模拟支付
    webApp->>paymentService: POST /api/orders/{id}/pay
    paymentService->>mysql: 校验当前用户为订单属主
    mysql-->>paymentService: 订单和锁座截止时间
    paymentService->>mysql: 开始事务，条件更新为 CONFIRMED
    mysql-->>paymentService: PENDING 且未到期，影响一行
    paymentService->>mysql: 库存 lockedSeats 减一、confirmedSeats 加一
    paymentService->>mysql: 写入支付记录，提交事务
    paymentService-->>webApp: 支付成功与最新订单
    webApp-->>user: 展示已确认状态
